{
  "name": "PAD Open Lower Extremity Revascularization with MACCE",
  "remarks": [
    "Models the full clinical pathway for peripheral arterial disease (PAD) from initial",
    "diagnosis through treatment strategy selection, and — for patients who receive open",
    "lower extremity revascularization — through the 30-day MACCE outcome window.",
    "",
    "This module was derived from pad_ssi.json by replacing the SSI preoperative",
    "comorbidity block with the 25 model-derived preoperative features from",
    "covariates/covariate_concepts.csv (sourced from model/varImp.rds), and replacing",
    "the SSI outcome states with the five MACCE components.",
    "",
    "Clinical workflow:",
    "  1a. PAD onset delay: Uniform(0, 20) years after age 60 (onset age 60-80)",
    "  1b. PAD diagnosis (ConditionOnset) — capped at age 90",
    "  2. Outpatient PAD diagnosis encounter",
    "  3. Document presenting symptom (asymptomatic, claudication, rest pain, wound/tissue loss)",
    "  4. Document preoperative features (cardiac conditions, antiplatelet/cardiac drugs,",
    "     and key laboratory measurements) derived from model covariate importance",
    "  5. Ankle-brachial index (ABI) measurement",
    "  6. End outpatient encounter",
    "  7. Treatment strategy decision:",
    "       - Medical management (10%) → Terminal",
    "       - Endovascular revascularization (10%) → Terminal",
    "       - Open surgical revascularization (80%) → MACCE pathway",
    "  8. Pre-surgical workup delay (1-6 months)",
    "  9. Urgency flag (25% urgent/emergent)",
    " 10. Inpatient surgical admission → perioperative cefazolin → open revascularization",
    " 11. Post-operative inpatient stay (3-7 days) → discharge",
    " 12. MACCE risk check → outcome pathway or Terminal",
    "",
    "Cohort definitions:",
    "  Target  : inpatient surgery for open lower extremity revascularization",
    "  Outcome : MACCE (MI, cardiac arrest, heart failure, stroke, or death) within 30 days",
    "",
    "MACCE incidence assumptions:",
    "  Fixed MACCE incidence after open surgery: 15%",
    "  MACCE component distribution (of all MACCE cases):",
    "    Myocardial infarction  (SNOMED 22298006)  : 30%",
    "    Cardiac arrest         (SNOMED 410429000) : 15%",
    "    Heart failure          (SNOMED 84114007)  : 25%",
    "    Stroke/cerebral infarct(SNOMED 432504007) : 20%",
    "    Cardiac death          (SNOMED 95281009)  : 10%",
    "",
    "Preoperative covariate prevalence assumptions (from model/varImp.rds, covariates/covariates.csv):",
    "  Conditions (prevalence in this PAD surgical population):",
    "    Ischemic heart disease     : 45%",
    "    Angina pectoris            : 20%",
    "    Heart failure              : 15%",
    "    Cerebral infarction        : 10%",
    "    Myocardial infarction      : 15%",
    "    Congestive heart failure   : 15%",
    "    Myocardial disease         : 10%",
    "    Chest pain                 : 25%",
    "    Brain injury               : 5%",
    "    Structural heart disorder  : 20%",
    "  Drugs (prevalence):",
    "    Clopidogrel                : 30%",
    "    Cardiac vasodilators       : 25%",
    "    Antithrombotic agents      : 50%",
    "    Beta blockers              : 40%",
    "    Aspirin                    : 55%",
    "    Organic nitrates           : 20%",
    "  Measurements: all generated as continuous ranges consistent with PAD patient norms",
    "",
    "Primary concept codes (OMOP-mappable):",
    "  PAD condition                  : SNOMED-CT 399957001",
    "  Femoro-popliteal bypass        : SNOMED-CT 112828007",
    "  Femoral endarterectomy         : SNOMED-CT 16589005",
    "  Aortobifemoral bypass          : SNOMED-CT 405482000",
    "  Femoro-tibial bypass           : SNOMED-CT 47575002",
    "  Extra-anatomic bypass          : SNOMED-CT 73985009",
    "  Ischemic heart disease         : SNOMED-CT 414545008",
    "  Angina pectoris                : SNOMED-CT 194828000",
    "  Heart failure                  : SNOMED-CT 84114007",
    "  Cerebral infarction            : SNOMED-CT 432504007",
    "  Myocardial infarction          : SNOMED-CT 22298006",
    "  Congestive heart failure       : SNOMED-CT 42343007",
    "  Myocardial disease             : SNOMED-CT 57809008",
    "  Chest pain (cardiac)           : SNOMED-CT 29857009",
    "  Brain injury                   : SNOMED-CT 127295002",
    "  Structural heart disorder      : SNOMED-CT 128599005",
    "  Cardiac arrest (MACCE outcome) : SNOMED-CT 410429000",
    "  Cardiac death  (MACCE outcome) : SNOMED-CT 95281009",
    "  Stroke (MACCE outcome)         : SNOMED-CT 432504007",
    "  Ankle-brachial index           : LOINC      77194-9",
    "  CK-MB mass                     : LOINC      13969-1",
    "  Neutrophil %                   : LOINC      770-8",
    "  Serum creatinine               : LOINC      2160-0",
    "  Hemoglobin                     : LOINC      718-7",
    "  Total cholesterol              : LOINC      2093-3",
    "  WBC count                      : LOINC      6690-2",
    "  hsCRP                          : LOINC      30522-7",
    "  HbA1c (HPLC)                   : LOINC      17856-6",
    "  Platelet count                 : LOINC      777-3",
    "  Clopidogrel                    : RxNorm     749196",
    "  Aspirin                        : RxNorm     1191",
    "  Nitroglycerin (nitrate)        : RxNorm     4917",
    "  Cefazolin (ppx)                : RxNorm     2180",
    "",
    "Timing:",
    "  Pre-surgical workup delay : 1-6 months after PAD diagnosis",
    "  Inpatient stay            : 3-7 days post-surgery",
    "  MACCE outcome window      : 0-30 days post-surgery (inside or shortly after admission)",
    "",
    "Usage:",
    "  Copy to <synthea_home>/src/main/resources/modules/ and run Synthea normally.",
    "  To load into the omop_synth database, run this project's Step 5 CSV-to-OMOP ETL workflow.",
    "",
    "Does NOT model: mortality beyond cardiac death MACCE component, limb loss, or graft failure."
  ],
  "states": {

    "Initial": {
      "type": "Initial",
      "direct_transition": "Age_Guard"
    },

    "Age_Guard": {
      "type": "Guard",
      "allow": {
        "condition_type": "Age",
        "operator": ">=",
        "quantity": 60,
        "unit": "years"
      },
      "direct_transition": "PAD_Onset_Delay"
    },

    "PAD_Onset_Delay": {
      "type": "Delay",
      "remarks": [
        "PAD onset delay: Uniform(0, 20) years after age 60 (onset age 60-80).",
        "Age_90_Check ensures no procedure occurs on patients over age 90."
      ],
      "range": {
        "low": 0,
        "high": 20,
        "unit": "years"
      },
      "direct_transition": "Age_90_Check"
    },

    "Age_90_Check": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "remarks": [
        "Cap the PAD pathway at age 90. Patients older than 90 after the",
        "onset delay are routed to Terminal so procedure ages stay realistic."
      ],
      "conditional_transition": [
        {
          "condition": {
            "condition_type": "Age",
            "operator": "<=",
            "quantity": 90,
            "unit": "years"
          },
          "transition": "PAD_Onset"
        },
        {
          "transition": "Terminal"
        }
      ]
    },

    "PAD_Onset": {
      "type": "ConditionOnset",
      "codes": [
        {
          "system": "SNOMED-CT",
          "code": "399957001",
          "display": "Peripheral arterial occlusive disease"
        }
      ],
      "direct_transition": "PAD_Diagnosis_Encounter"
    },

    "PAD_Diagnosis_Encounter": {
      "type": "Encounter",
      "encounter_class": "outpatient",
      "reason": "PAD_Onset",
      "codes": [
        {
          "system": "SNOMED-CT",
          "code": "185349003",
          "display": "Encounter for check up"
        }
      ],
      "remarks": [
        "Initial outpatient PAD evaluation encounter.",
        "Presenting symptom, preoperative comorbidities, and ABI documented here."
      ],
      "direct_transition": "Presenting_Symptom"
    },

    "Presenting_Symptom": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "remarks": [
        "Documents presenting symptom / Rutherford class at first evaluation.",
        "Rutherford 0: asymptomatic (10%)",
        "Rutherford 1-3: claudication (50%)",
        "Rutherford 4: rest pain (25%)",
        "Rutherford 5-6: wound / tissue loss (15%)"
      ],
      "distributed_transition": [
        { "distribution": 0.10, "transition": "Symptom_Asymptomatic" },
        { "distribution": 0.50, "transition": "Symptom_Claudication" },
        { "distribution": 0.25, "transition": "Symptom_Rest_Pain" },
        { "distribution": 0.15, "transition": "Symptom_Wound" }
      ]
    },

    "Symptom_Asymptomatic": {
      "type": "Observation",
      "category": "survey",
      "codes": [
        {
          "system": "SNOMED-CT",
          "code": "84387000",
          "display": "Asymptomatic"
        }
      ],
      "direct_transition": "IHD_Chance"
    },

    "Symptom_Claudication": {
      "type": "ConditionOnset",
      "codes": [
        {
          "system": "SNOMED-CT",
          "code": "63491006",
          "display": "Intermittent claudication"
        }
      ],
      "direct_transition": "IHD_Chance"
    },

    "Symptom_Rest_Pain": {
      "type": "ConditionOnset",
      "codes": [
        {
          "system": "SNOMED-CT",
          "code": "428171009",
          "display": "Peripheral vascular disease with rest pain"
        }
      ],
      "direct_transition": "IHD_Chance"
    },

    "Symptom_Wound": {
      "type": "ConditionOnset",
      "codes": [
        {
          "system": "SNOMED-CT",
          "code": "238794007",
          "display": "Ischemic foot ulcer"
        }
      ],
      "direct_transition": "IHD_Chance"
    },

    "IHD_Chance": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "remarks": [
        "Ischemic heart disease — top-ranked model covariate (covariateValue ~0.0097).",
        "Prevalence 45% in this PAD surgical population.",
        "SNOMED-CT 414545008 = Ischemic heart disease (OMOP concept 4185932, standard)."
      ],
      "distributed_transition": [
        { "distribution": 0.45, "transition": "IHD_Onset" },
        { "distribution": 0.55, "transition": "Angina_Chance" }
      ]
    },

    "IHD_Onset": {
      "type": "ConditionOnset",
      "codes": [
        {
          "system": "SNOMED-CT",
          "code": "414545008",
          "display": "Ischemic heart disease"
        }
      ],
      "direct_transition": "Angina_Chance"
    },

    "Angina_Chance": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "remarks": [
        "Angina pectoris — second-ranked model covariate (covariateValue ~0.0061).",
        "Prevalence 20%.",
        "SNOMED-CT 194828000 = Angina pectoris (OMOP concept 321318, standard)."
      ],
      "distributed_transition": [
        { "distribution": 0.20, "transition": "Angina_Onset" },
        { "distribution": 0.80, "transition": "Heart_Failure_Chance" }
      ]
    },

    "Angina_Onset": {
      "type": "ConditionOnset",
      "codes": [
        {
          "system": "SNOMED-CT",
          "code": "194828000",
          "display": "Angina pectoris"
        }
      ],
      "direct_transition": "Heart_Failure_Chance"
    },

    "Heart_Failure_Chance": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "remarks": [
        "Heart failure — model covariate rank 3 (covariateValue ~0.0044).",
        "Prevalence 15%.",
        "SNOMED-CT 84114007 = Heart failure (OMOP concept 316139, standard)."
      ],
      "distributed_transition": [
        { "distribution": 0.15, "transition": "Heart_Failure_Onset" },
        { "distribution": 0.85, "transition": "Cerebral_Infarction_Chance" }
      ]
    },

    "Heart_Failure_Onset": {
      "type": "ConditionOnset",
      "codes": [
        {
          "system": "SNOMED-CT",
          "code": "84114007",
          "display": "Heart failure"
        }
      ],
      "direct_transition": "Cerebral_Infarction_Chance"
    },

    "Cerebral_Infarction_Chance": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "remarks": [
        "Cerebral infarction — model covariate rank 4 (covariateValue ~0.0048).",
        "Prevalence 10%.",
        "SNOMED-CT 432504007 = Cerebral infarction (OMOP concept 443454, standard)."
      ],
      "distributed_transition": [
        { "distribution": 0.10, "transition": "Cerebral_Infarction_Onset" },
        { "distribution": 0.90, "transition": "MI_History_Chance" }
      ]
    },

    "Cerebral_Infarction_Onset": {
      "type": "ConditionOnset",
      "codes": [
        {
          "system": "SNOMED-CT",
          "code": "432504007",
          "display": "Cerebral infarction"
        }
      ],
      "direct_transition": "MI_History_Chance"
    },

    "MI_History_Chance": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "remarks": [
        "Prior myocardial infarction — model covariate (OMOP concept 4329847).",
        "Prevalence 15%.",
        "SNOMED-CT 22298006 = Myocardial infarction (OMOP concept 4329847, standard)."
      ],
      "distributed_transition": [
        { "distribution": 0.15, "transition": "MI_History_Onset" },
        { "distribution": 0.85, "transition": "CHF_Chance" }
      ]
    },

    "MI_History_Onset": {
      "type": "ConditionOnset",
      "codes": [
        {
          "system": "SNOMED-CT",
          "code": "22298006",
          "display": "Myocardial infarction"
        }
      ],
      "direct_transition": "CHF_Chance"
    },

    "CHF_Chance": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "remarks": [
        "Congestive heart failure — model covariate (OMOP concept 319835).",
        "Prevalence 15%. Separate from Heart_Failure_Chance above (concept 316139).",
        "SNOMED-CT 42343007 = Congestive heart failure (OMOP concept 319835, standard)."
      ],
      "distributed_transition": [
        { "distribution": 0.15, "transition": "CHF_Onset" },
        { "distribution": 0.85, "transition": "Myocardial_Disease_Chance" }
      ]
    },

    "CHF_Onset": {
      "type": "ConditionOnset",
      "codes": [
        {
          "system": "SNOMED-CT",
          "code": "42343007",
          "display": "Congestive heart failure"
        }
      ],
      "direct_transition": "Myocardial_Disease_Chance"
    },

    "Myocardial_Disease_Chance": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "remarks": [
        "Myocardial disease — model covariate (OMOP concept 4239975).",
        "Prevalence 10%.",
        "SNOMED-CT 57809008 = Myocardial disease (OMOP concept 4239975, standard)."
      ],
      "distributed_transition": [
        { "distribution": 0.10, "transition": "Myocardial_Disease_Onset" },
        { "distribution": 0.90, "transition": "Chest_Pain_Chance" }
      ]
    },

    "Myocardial_Disease_Onset": {
      "type": "ConditionOnset",
      "codes": [
        {
          "system": "SNOMED-CT",
          "code": "57809008",
          "display": "Myocardial disease"
        }
      ],
      "direct_transition": "Chest_Pain_Chance"
    },

    "Chest_Pain_Chance": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "remarks": [
        "Chest pain — model covariate (OMOP concept 77670).",
        "Prevalence 25%.",
        "SNOMED-CT 29857009 = Chest pain (OMOP concept 77670, standard)."
      ],
      "distributed_transition": [
        { "distribution": 0.25, "transition": "Chest_Pain_Onset" },
        { "distribution": 0.75, "transition": "Brain_Injury_Chance" }
      ]
    },

    "Chest_Pain_Onset": {
      "type": "ConditionOnset",
      "codes": [
        {
          "system": "SNOMED-CT",
          "code": "29857009",
          "display": "Chest pain"
        }
      ],
      "direct_transition": "Brain_Injury_Chance"
    },

    "Brain_Injury_Chance": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "remarks": [
        "Traumatic or non-traumatic brain injury — model covariate (OMOP concept 4133611).",
        "Prevalence 5%.",
        "SNOMED-CT 127295002 = Traumatic brain injury (OMOP concept 4133611, standard)."
      ],
      "distributed_transition": [
        { "distribution": 0.05, "transition": "Brain_Injury_Onset" },
        { "distribution": 0.95, "transition": "Structural_Heart_Disorder_Chance" }
      ]
    },

    "Brain_Injury_Onset": {
      "type": "ConditionOnset",
      "codes": [
        {
          "system": "SNOMED-CT",
          "code": "127295002",
          "display": "Traumatic brain injury"
        }
      ],
      "direct_transition": "Structural_Heart_Disorder_Chance"
    },

    "Structural_Heart_Disorder_Chance": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "remarks": [
        "Structural disorder of heart — model covariate (OMOP concept 4027255).",
        "Prevalence 20%.",
        "SNOMED-CT 128599005 = Structural disorder of heart (OMOP concept 4027255, standard)."
      ],
      "distributed_transition": [
        { "distribution": 0.20, "transition": "Structural_Heart_Disorder_Onset" },
        { "distribution": 0.80, "transition": "Clopidogrel_Chance" }
      ]
    },

    "Structural_Heart_Disorder_Onset": {
      "type": "ConditionOnset",
      "codes": [
        {
          "system": "SNOMED-CT",
          "code": "128599005",
          "display": "Structural disorder of heart"
        }
      ],
      "direct_transition": "Clopidogrel_Chance"
    },

    "Clopidogrel_Chance": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "remarks": [
        "Clopidogrel — top-ranked drug covariate (OMOP concept 1322184, RxNorm 749196).",
        "Prevalence 30%.",
        "Started during evaluation encounter to represent pre-index antiplatelet therapy."
      ],
      "distributed_transition": [
        { "distribution": 0.30, "transition": "Clopidogrel_Order" },
        { "distribution": 0.70, "transition": "Cardiac_Vasodilator_Chance" }
      ]
    },

    "Clopidogrel_Order": {
      "type": "MedicationOrder",
      "assign_to_attribute": "clopidogrel_preop",
      "reason": "PAD_Onset",
      "codes": [
        {
          "system": "RxNorm",
          "code": "749196",
          "display": "clopidogrel 75 MG Oral Tablet"
        }
      ],
      "direct_transition": "Cardiac_Vasodilator_Chance"
    },

    "Cardiac_Vasodilator_Chance": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "remarks": [
        "Cardiac vasodilators (ATC C01D, OMOP concept 21600315).",
        "Prevalence 25%.",
        "Represented via nitroglycerin as the most common agent in this class."
      ],
      "distributed_transition": [
        { "distribution": 0.25, "transition": "Cardiac_Vasodilator_Order" },
        { "distribution": 0.75, "transition": "Antithrombotic_Chance" }
      ]
    },

    "Cardiac_Vasodilator_Order": {
      "type": "MedicationOrder",
      "assign_to_attribute": "cardiac_vasodilator_preop",
      "reason": "PAD_Onset",
      "codes": [
        {
          "system": "RxNorm",
          "code": "4917",
          "display": "nitroglycerin"
        }
      ],
      "direct_transition": "Antithrombotic_Chance"
    },

    "Antithrombotic_Chance": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "remarks": [
        "Antithrombotic agents (ATC B01A, OMOP concept 21600961).",
        "Prevalence 50%.",
        "Represented via heparin as a common broad antithrombotic in this class."
      ],
      "distributed_transition": [
        { "distribution": 0.50, "transition": "Antithrombotic_Order" },
        { "distribution": 0.50, "transition": "Beta_Blocker_Chance" }
      ]
    },

    "Antithrombotic_Order": {
      "type": "MedicationOrder",
      "assign_to_attribute": "antithrombotic_preop",
      "reason": "PAD_Onset",
      "codes": [
        {
          "system": "RxNorm",
          "code": "237057",
          "display": "heparin sodium"
        }
      ],
      "direct_transition": "Beta_Blocker_Chance"
    },

    "Beta_Blocker_Chance": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "remarks": [
        "Beta blocking agents other combinations (ATC C07, OMOP concept 1123698).",
        "Prevalence 40%.",
        "Represented via metoprolol as the most common beta blocker in this population."
      ],
      "distributed_transition": [
        { "distribution": 0.40, "transition": "Beta_Blocker_Order" },
        { "distribution": 0.60, "transition": "Aspirin_Chance" }
      ]
    },

    "Beta_Blocker_Order": {
      "type": "MedicationOrder",
      "assign_to_attribute": "beta_blocker_preop",
      "reason": "PAD_Onset",
      "codes": [
        {
          "system": "RxNorm",
          "code": "866514",
          "display": "metoprolol succinate 25 MG Extended Release Oral Tablet"
        }
      ],
      "direct_transition": "Aspirin_Chance"
    },

    "Aspirin_Chance": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "remarks": [
        "Aspirin (OMOP concept 1112807, RxNorm 1191).",
        "Prevalence 55%.",
        "Antiplatelet standard of care for PAD patients."
      ],
      "distributed_transition": [
        { "distribution": 0.55, "transition": "Aspirin_Order" },
        { "distribution": 0.45, "transition": "Organic_Nitrate_Chance" }
      ]
    },

    "Aspirin_Order": {
      "type": "MedicationOrder",
      "assign_to_attribute": "aspirin_preop",
      "reason": "PAD_Onset",
      "codes": [
        {
          "system": "RxNorm",
          "code": "1191",
          "display": "aspirin"
        }
      ],
      "direct_transition": "Organic_Nitrate_Chance"
    },

    "Organic_Nitrate_Chance": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "remarks": [
        "Organic nitrates (ATC C01DA, OMOP concept 21600316).",
        "Prevalence 20%.",
        "Isosorbide mononitrate as representative long-acting nitrate."
      ],
      "distributed_transition": [
        { "distribution": 0.20, "transition": "Organic_Nitrate_Order" },
        { "distribution": 0.80, "transition": "Lab_CK_MB" }
      ]
    },

    "Organic_Nitrate_Order": {
      "type": "MedicationOrder",
      "assign_to_attribute": "organic_nitrate_preop",
      "reason": "PAD_Onset",
      "codes": [
        {
          "system": "RxNorm",
          "code": "41493",
          "display": "isosorbide mononitrate"
        }
      ],
      "direct_transition": "Lab_CK_MB"
    },

    "Lab_CK_MB": {
      "type": "Observation",
      "category": "laboratory",
      "unit": "ng/mL",
      "codes": [
        {
          "system": "LOINC",
          "code": "13969-1",
          "display": "Creatine kinase.MB [Mass/volume] in Serum or Plasma"
        }
      ],
      "remarks": [
        "CK-MB — top-ranked measurement covariate (OMOP concept 3005785).",
        "Normal range: 0-3 ng/mL. Elevated values reflect myocardial stress.",
        "LOINC 13969-1 maps to OMOP concept 3005785 (Measurement domain)."
      ],
      "range": { "low": 0.5, "high": 8.0 },
      "direct_transition": "Lab_Neutrophil_Pct"
    },

    "Lab_Neutrophil_Pct": {
      "type": "Observation",
      "category": "laboratory",
      "unit": "%",
      "codes": [
        {
          "system": "LOINC",
          "code": "770-8",
          "display": "Neutrophils/100 leukocytes in Blood by Automated count"
        }
      ],
      "remarks": [
        "Neutrophil percentage — CBC differential (OMOP concept 3012608).",
        "Normal range: 45-75%. Elevated values reflect systemic inflammation.",
        "LOINC 770-8 maps to OMOP concept 3012608 (Measurement domain)."
      ],
      "range": { "low": 45, "high": 82 },
      "direct_transition": "Lab_Creatinine"
    },

    "Lab_Creatinine": {
      "type": "Observation",
      "category": "laboratory",
      "unit": "mg/dL",
      "codes": [
        {
          "system": "LOINC",
          "code": "2160-0",
          "display": "Creatinine [Mass/volume] in Serum or Plasma"
        }
      ],
      "remarks": [
        "Serum creatinine — renal function marker (OMOP concept 3016723).",
        "Normal: 0.6-1.2 mg/dL. Elevated in CKD, common comorbidity in PAD.",
